oaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/TASK.md","text":"Create a REST API service for managing a book collection.\n\nRequirements:\n- POST /books — Create a new book (title, author, year, isbn)\n- GET /books — List all books (support ?author= filter)\n- GET /books/{id} — Get a single book by ID\n- PUT /books/{id} — Update a book\n- DELETE /books/{id} — Delete a book\n\nTechnical constraints:\n- Use the specified language and framework\n- Store data in SQLite (or language-equivalent embedded DB)\n- Return JSON responses with appropriate HTTP status codes\n- Include input validation (title and author are required)\n- Include a health check endpoint: GET /health\n\nDeliverables:\n- Working source code in the workspace directory\n- A README.md with setup and run instructions\n- At least 3 unit/integration tests","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":20,"totalLines":20,"truncated":false}},"title":"TASK.md","time":{"start":1788225734405,"end":1788225734468}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me start by reading TASK.md to understand what's being asked.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05a8f46f5001Dp49fmh1SxL4bO","sessionID":"ses_fa570caecffeqmzUmkVgycH4Xs","messageID":"msg_05a8f396600139L9xsMkrYkfWt"}}
